error[E4101]: cannot borrow `p.first` as shared because it is mutably borrowed
  --> tests/borrows/fail/E4101_same_field.tarn:30:10
   |
29 |     a := &mut p.first
   |          ------------ mutable borrow of `p.first` starts here
30 |     b := &p.first
   |          ^^^^^^^^ shared borrow conflicts here
31 |     write(a)
   |           - the borrow is still used here
   |
   = note: a borrow lasts until the last use of the reference that holds it

